last_updated:           2026-10-02
source_event:           archives/g/greenlet/3.5.6（PR #10408：收集期 15 errors，尾部切片未含异常行）
authors:                AtomCode <noreply@atomgit.com>
source_pr:              10408
source_commit:          8248c523e
metrics_success_count:  0
metrics_fail_count:     1
metrics_confidence:     0.9

